[Desktop Entry]
Type=Application
Name=Kylin Monitor Task Manager
Name[zh_CN]=Kylin Monitor 任务管理器
Comment=Task manager with process control and CPU, GPU and memory monitoring
Comment[zh_CN]=进程管理、CPU、GPU 与内存监测
